<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_matrix__interpolation_8hpp">glm/gtx/matrix_interpolation.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para>Allows to directly interpolate two matrices.</para>
</section>
